OL,3,GNEWSAYour guide to West Midlands'
OL,4,ARemembrance events
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are set to attend
OL,7,FRemembrance Sunday services across the
OL,8,FWest Midlands next weekend to honour
OL,9,FArmed forces personnel.
OL,11,FMembers of the public will join
OL,12,Fveterans and current servicemen and
OL,13,Fwomen at events marking the annual
OL,14,Foccasion on 8 November.
OL,16,FMany will involve a parade before
OL,17,Fwreaths are laid ahead of the
OL,18,Fnationwide two-minute silence at 11:00
OL,19,FGMT.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
